              <pre class="text-prompt text-xxs leading-normal overflow-x-auto m-0 select-all">
POST /api/posts (Multer 25MB Buffer)
  └─► sharp(buffer).rotate()
        ├─► resize(1200, 1200).webp(85)  ──► uploads/images/*.webp
        └─► resize(400, 400).webp(80)    ──► uploads/thumbs/*.webp
              └─► buildQueue.enqueue('User:<userId>')
                    ├─► setUseTemplateCache(false)
                    ├─► Eleventy compiles HTML/CSS
                    └─► deployToNeocities() 
                          ├─► POST https://neocities.org/api/upload
                          └─► fs.rm(uploadsDir) [0 MB DISK RETENTION]</pre>
